      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 58
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 58
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 58
    },
    {
      "text": "Between two notes is finished at 58 marks. The wider, loaded oil makes a clean streak at whole view, and the plum gap stays continuous. The bristle ridges show at 2×. I’m leaving the softer shadow and cloth folds as they are.",
      "kind": "keep",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
